-- #987 wave 1 (pure additions): Stonetalon Mountains creature abilities, imported from DeltaTho PR 15 file 2026_10_24_35_world.sql.
-- 105 creatures, 237 smart_scripts rows. Only creatures that have NO source_type 0 rows today are written here;
-- scripts that would replace existing rows are wave 2. Filters/fixes: see (not shipped)
